  "releaseNotes": "0.4.0 adds semantic OSC 0/1/2 title operations through TerminalSession.SetTitleAsync, SetIconNameAsync, and SetWindowTitleAsync; strict UTF-8 and injection-safe framing; bounded 4096-byte title payload policy; coordinated session-owned output ordering; explicit emission/support semantics; and package-only multi-target consumer validation for net8.0, net9.0, and net10.0.",
